  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.26 Redevelopment costs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.26 “Redevelopment costs” means the costs of land or site acquisition, demolition, abatement, remediation, excavation, and construction of infrastructure.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
